      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does \"CRYPTO_ENGINE is now used by Android userspace\" mean?  It\u0027s a kernel-internal library that\u0027s only used by crypto drivers that select it.  It is actually that it needs to be available in case a vendor has a crypto driver that uses this library?\n\nAlso, is this really intended to fix b/130424539?  I don\u0027t see how this has anything to do with it.",
