      "writtenOn": "2020-01-29T20:56:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Whether it\u0027s needed depends on whether anyone has a crypto driver that needs it.  Note that it\u0027s not needed for inline encryption; it\u0027s only relevant for the regular crypto API.\n\nIf we want to error on the side of building library code into GKI just in case someone needs it, that\u0027s fine.  Just keep in mind that without a real-world user in mind already, it could result in code that no one ever actually needs, and it will be difficult to determine whether it can be removed later.",
